its to the human source.\"\n    },\n    \"agent\": {\n      \"initial_records\": [],\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"task_id\",\n        \"dataset_manifest_hash\",\n        \"protocol_hash\"\n      ],\n      \"storage\": \"append-only experiment receipts and evidence-linked observations, explanations, counterexamples and superseding revisions\",\n      \"maturity\": [\n        \"hypothesis\",\n        \"local_observation\",\n        \"controlled_support\",\n        \"repeated_support\"\n      ],\n      \"cross_task_import\": \"explicit external unverified reference only\",\n      \"withheld_results\": \"closed assessment archive, never open research memory for a reused holdout\",\n      \"delivery\": \"This topic's receipts and explicit imported controls only; old campaigns are not local evidence.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"research_flow\": {\n    \"entry\": \"audit actual fields, causal availability, label prevalence, compute, existing code and complete-unit experiment cost\",\n    \"baseline_requirements\": [\n      \"A reproducible DIN local-activation reference adapted to actual fields and four labels.\"\n    ],\n    \"reference_candidates_not_prescribed\": [\n      \"DIN establishes the initial empirical reference. Unified candidates may replace the whole model; later controls should include the closest architectural alternatives.\"\n    ],\n    \"question_selection\": \"Choose a concrete observed limitation after baseline and slice diagnostics. Do not preselect a winning mechanism from the industry cards.\",\n    \"proposal_schema\": \"../../agent/study.schema.json\",\n    \"nearest_work_check\": \"Check the nearest unified architecture and mechanism, record inherited components and differences, and verify primary sources before originality claims.\",\n    \"attribution\": [\n      \"paired single-factor contrasts\",\n      \"replacement or capacity-matched controls\",\n      \"factorial controls for interacting changes\",\n      \"lineage-aware comparison of positive